/ The channel's written value (the question text) reaches its goal as %message%; capture it into a local
/ %access% first. Subsequent steps branch on %access% — stable for the whole goal.
VerbBasedAnswerer
- set %access% = %message%
- if %access% contains 'write' then return "y"
- if %access% contains 'delete' then return "n"
- if %access% contains 'read' then return "a"
- return "n"
